[All]
PhoneRing=[Normal](*PHONE RINGING*) (Note: Click on the phone in the office to skip the phone call.)
N1P1=[Normal]Hello? H-Hello?
N1P2=[Normal]Uh, I wanted to record a message for you... To help you get settled in on your first night.
N1P3=[Normal]Um, I actually worked in that office before you... I'm finishing up my last week now as a matter of fact, so...
N1P4=[Normal]I know it can be a bit overwhelming, but I'm hear to tell you there's nothing to worry about. You'll do fine!
N1P5=[Normal]So, let's just focus on getting you through your first week, okay?
N1P6=[Normal]Uh, let's see, first there's an introductory greeting from the company that I'm supposed to read... Uh, it's kind of a legal thing, you know.
N1P7=[Normal]Welcome to Freddy Fazbear's Pizza, a magical place for kids and grown-ups alike, where fantasy and fun come to life.
N1P8=[Normal]Fazbear Entertainment is not responsible for damage to property or person...
N1P9=[Normal]Upon discovering that damage or death has occurred, a missing person report will be filed within 90 days or as soon as property and premises have been thoroughly cleaned and bleached, and the carpets have been replaced.
N1P10=[Normal]Blah, blah, blah.
N1P11=[Normal]Now that might sound bad, I know. But there's really nothing to worry about.
N1P12=[Normal]Uh, the animatronic characters here do get a bit quirky at night, but do I blame them? No!
N1P13=[Normal]If I were forced to sing those same stupid songs for 20 years and I never got a bath? I'd probably be a bit irritable at night too.
N1P14=[Normal]So remember, these characters hold a special place in the hearts of children, and you need to show them a little respect. Right? Okay.
N1P15=[Normal]So just be aware, the characters do tend to wander a bit.
N1P16=[Normal]Uh, they're left in some kind of free-roaming mode at night. Uh, something about their servos locking up if they get turned off for too long...
N1P17=[Normal]Uh, they used to be allowed to walk around during the day too. But then there was the Bite of '87. Yeah...
N1P18=[Normal]It's amazing that the human body can live without the frontal lobe, y'know?
N1P19=[Normal]Uh, now concerning your safety, the only real risk to you as a night watchman here, if any, is the fact that these characters...
N1P20=[Normal]Uh, if they happen to see you after hours, they probably won't recognize you as a person.
N1P21=[Normal]They'll mostly likely see you as a metal endoskeleton without its costume on.
N1P22=[Normal]Now, since that's against the rules here at Freddy Fazbear's Pizza, they'll probably try to... Forcefully stuff you inside a Freddy Fazbear suit.
N1P23=[Normal]Um, now that wouldn't be so bad if the suits themselves weren't filled with crossbeams, wires, and animatronic devices. Especially around the facial area.
N1P24=[Normal]So you can imagine how having your head forcefully pressed inside one of those could cause a bit of discomfort... And death...
N1P25=[Normal]Uh, the only parts of you that would likely see the light of day again would be your eyeballs and teeth would pop out the front of the mask.
N1P26=[Normal]Yeah, they don't tell you these things when you sign up.
N1P27=[Normal]But hey, first day should be a breeze. I'll chat with you tomorrow.
N1P28=[Normal]Uh, checks those cameras, and remember to close the doors only if absolutely necessary. Gotta conserve power.
N1P29=[Normal]Alright, goodnight.
N2P1=[Normal]Uh, hello? Hello?
N2P2=[Normal]Uh, well if you're hearing this and you made it to day two, uh, congrats!
N2P3=[Normal]I won't talk quite as long this time since Freddy and his friends tend to become more active as the week progresses.
N2P4=[Normal]Uh, it might be a good idea to peek at those cameras while I talk, just to make sure everyone's in their proper place, you know...
N2P5=[Normal]Uh, interestingly enough Freddy himself doesn't come off stage very often.
N2P6=[Normal]I heard he becomes a lot more active in the dark though, so hey, I guess that's one more reason not to run out of power, right?
N2P7=[Normal]I also want to emphasize the importance of using your door lights. Uh, there are blind spots in your camera views.
N2P8=[Normal]And those blind spots happen to be right outside your doors. So if you can't find something...
N2P9=[Normal]...Or someone on your cameras, uh, be sure to check the door lights. Uh, you might only have a few seconds to react.
N2P10=[Normal]Uh, not that you would be in any danger of course, I'm not implying that...
N2P11=[Normal]Also, check on the curtain in Pirate Cove from time to time.
N2P12=[Normal]The character in there seems unique in that he becomes more active if the cameras remain off for long periods of time.
N2P13=[Normal]I guess he doesn't like being watched, I don't know.
N2P14=[Normal]Anyway, I'm sure you have everything under control, talk to you soon!
N3P1=[Normal]Hello?
N3P2=[Normal]Hey, you're doing great! Most people don't last this long!
N3P3=[Normal]I mean, you know, they usually move on to other things by now...
N3P4=[Normal]I'm not implying that they died. Th-that's not what I meant.
N3P5=[Normal]Anyway, I better not take up too much of your time. Things start getting real tonight.
N3P6=[Normal]Uh, hey listen, I had an idea...
N3P7=[Normal]If you happen to get caught and want to avoid getting stuffed into a Freddy suit, try playing dead. You know, go limp.
N3P8=[Normal]Then there's a chance that maybe they'll think you're an empty costume instead.
N3P9=[Normal]Then again, if they think you're an empty costume, they might try to stuff a metal endoskeleton into you... I wonder how that'd work.
N3P10=[Normal]Yeah, nevermind, scratch that. It's best just not to get caught. Um...
N3P11=[Normal]Okay, I'll leave you to it. See you on the flip side!
N4P1=[Normal]Hello, hello? Hey! Hey, wow, day four, I knew you could do it. Hey, listen...
N4P2=[Normal]I may not be around to send you a message tomorrow... (*LOUD BANGING*) It's been a bad night here... For me. (*LOUD BANGING*)
N4P3=[Normal]Um, I'm kinda glad (*LOUD BANGING*) I recorded my messages for you, when I did.
N4P4=[Normal](*LOUD BANGING*) Uh, hey, do me a favor. Maybe sometime (*LOUD BANGING*) you could check inside those suits? In the back room?
N4P5=[Normal](*LOUD BANGING*) I'm gonna try to hold out until someone checks. (*LOUD BANGING*) Maybe it won't be so bad.
N4P6=[Normal](*LOUD BANGING*) Yeah, I always wondered what was in all those empty heads...
N4P7=[Normal]...Back there... (*FREDDY'S MUSIC BOX STARTS PLAYING*) Oh, no. (*EERIE MOAN*) Oh no...
N4P8=[Normal](*DEEP ROBOTIC YELL*) (*STATIC*) (*PHONE HANGS UP*)
N5P1=[Normal](*STATIC*) (*STRANGE ROBOTIC MUMBLING*) (*HIGH PITCH SCREAM*) (*PHONE HANGS UP*)